{
  "description": "One table of cases for every reader (schema 9.7.0): the progress bar and the progress ring. Rules: x-style.layout.progress; policy rows unknownToken, tokenWithoutFieldDefault, unorderedGradient. Numbers are logical pixels under the theme below (the spacing and the «pill» radius are the values of the built-in theme; the gradients are declared for this table). «readerOnly» — a value the builder does not produce or does not publish (an unknown word, a token the theme does not declare, a wrong form); a reader still has to draw it this way. Angles are degrees clockwise from the top of the ring.",
  "theme": {
    "spacing": { "none": 0, "xs": 4, "sm": 8, "md": 12, "lg": 16, "xl": 24 },
    "radius": { "pill": 72 },
    "color": { "primary": "#4f46e5", "secondary": "#eef0f6", "surface": "#ffffff", "accent": "#0369a1", "success": "#15803d" },
    "gradient": {
      "brand": { "angle": 90, "stops": [{ "color": "#4f46e5", "position": 0 }, { "color": "#0369a1", "position": 1 }] },
      "tricolor": { "angle": 180, "stops": [{ "color": "#ff0000", "position": 0 }, { "color": "#00ff00", "position": 0.5 }, { "color": "#0000ff", "position": 1 }] },
      "inset": { "angle": 45, "stops": [{ "color": "#4f46e5", "position": 0.25 }, { "color": "#15803d", "position": 0.75 }] }
    }
  },
  "defaults": { "thickness": "sm", "trackColor": "secondary", "color": "primary", "ringSize": "md", "ringSizeUnit": "xl" },
  "ratioCases": [
    { "name": "half of the scale", "value": 50, "max": 100, "expect": 0.5 },
    { "name": "the limit is not 100: three of four", "value": 3, "max": 4, "expect": 0.75 },
    { "name": "a fractional scale", "value": 0.25, "max": 0.5, "expect": 0.5 },
    { "name": "one third is not rounded", "value": 1, "max": 3, "expect": 0.3333333333333333 },
    { "name": "zero value: nothing is filled", "value": 0, "max": 100, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "value equal to the limit: the whole scale", "value": 100, "max": 100, "expect": 1 },
    { "name": "value over the limit is clamped to the whole scale", "value": 150, "max": 100, "expect": 1 },
    { "name": "negative value is clamped to nothing", "value": -5, "max": 100, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "limit 0 is NO scale, not a full one", "value": 5, "max": 0, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "limit 0 and value 0", "value": 0, "max": 0, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "negative limit is no scale", "value": 5, "max": -10, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "negative limit with a negative value is still no scale (not 0.5)", "value": -5, "max": -10, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "no value in the data (null): nothing is filled", "value": null, "max": 100, "readerOnly": true, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "no limit in the data (null): no scale", "value": 5, "max": null, "readerOnly": true, "expect": 0 },
    { "name": "a value that is a string is not a number", "value": "50", "max": 100, "readerOnly": true, "expect": 0 }
  ],
  "ringCases": [
    { "name": "size sm, no style: two units", "props": { "size": "sm" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 48, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 48, "boxBlock": 48 } },
    { "name": "size md, no style: three units", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "size lg, no style: four units", "props": { "size": "lg" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 96, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 96, "boxBlock": 96 } },
    { "name": "unknown size word (a newer minor): md", "props": { "size": "xl" }, "style": {}, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "no size field: md", "props": {}, "style": {}, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "style.width names the diameter; the height follows it", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 160 }, "expect": { "diameter": 160, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 160, "boxBlock": 160 } },
    { "name": "style.height names the diameter; the width follows it", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "height": 120 }, "expect": { "diameter": 120, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 120, "boxBlock": 120 } },
    { "name": "style is stronger than the size word", "props": { "size": "lg" }, "style": { "width": 40 }, "expect": { "diameter": 40, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 40, "boxBlock": 40 } },
    { "name": "wide box: the diameter is the smaller side, the ring is centred along the row", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 200, "height": 120 }, "expect": { "diameter": 120, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 200, "boxBlock": 120, "freeInline": 80, "freeBlock": 0 } },
    { "name": "tall box: the diameter is the smaller side, the ring is centred across the row", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 100, "height": 180 }, "expect": { "diameter": 100, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 100, "boxBlock": 180, "freeInline": 0, "freeBlock": 80 } },
    { "name": "the size includes the padding: the diameter is the content side", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 160, "padding": 12 }, "expect": { "diameter": 136, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 160, "boxBlock": 160 } },
    { "name": "the size includes the border", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 160, "border": 2 }, "expect": { "diameter": 156, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 160, "boxBlock": 160 } },
    { "name": "padding and border together", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 160, "padding": 12, "border": 2 }, "expect": { "diameter": 132, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 160, "boxBlock": 160 } },
    { "name": "padding alone names nothing: the size word, and the box grows around it", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "padding": 12 }, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 96, "boxBlock": 96 } },
    { "name": "a box smaller than its padding: no ring, the box stays", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 20, "padding": 12 }, "expect": { "diameter": 0, "thickness": 0, "boxInline": 20, "boxBlock": 24 } },
    { "name": "maxWidth caps the named width", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 300, "maxWidth": 200 }, "expect": { "diameter": 200, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 200, "boxBlock": 200 } },
    { "name": "minWidth alone names the side: the ring is not smaller than it", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "minWidth": 100 }, "expect": { "diameter": 100, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 100, "boxBlock": 100 } },
    { "name": "minWidth below the natural size changes nothing", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "minWidth": 40 }, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "maxWidth alone names the side: the ring is not larger than it", "props": { "size": "lg" }, "style": { "maxWidth": 40 }, "expect": { "diameter": 40, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 40, "boxBlock": 40 } },
    { "name": "minWidth with a named smaller height: the height wins, the ring is centred", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "minWidth": 100, "height": 60 }, "expect": { "diameter": 60, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 100, "boxBlock": 60, "freeInline": 40, "freeBlock": 0 } },
    { "name": "inverted range: the minimum wins", "props": { "size": "md" }, "style": { "width": 80, "minWidth": 120, "maxWidth": 100 }, "expect": { "diameter": 120, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 120, "boxBlock": 120 } },
    { "name": "under a row weight the width fields do not name the diameter", "props": { "size": "sm" }, "style": { "width": 200, "minWidth": 150 }, "applied": { "width": false, "height": true }, "expect": { "diameter": 48, "thickness": 8, "boxBlock": 48 } },
    { "name": "under a row weight a named height still names the diameter", "props": { "size": "sm" }, "style": { "width": 200, "height": 100 }, "applied": { "width": false, "height": true }, "expect": { "diameter": 100, "thickness": 8, "boxBlock": 100 } },
    { "name": "a fill layer of a stack: no field names the diameter", "props": { "size": "lg" }, "style": { "width": 200, "height": 200 }, "applied": { "width": false, "height": false }, "expect": { "diameter": 96, "thickness": 8 } },
    { "name": "thickness by a token", "props": { "size": "md", "thickness": "md" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 12, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "thickness by a number", "props": { "size": "md", "thickness": 20 }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 20, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "the thickness does not change the box: the arc is inside the circle", "props": { "size": "md", "thickness": 30 }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 30, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "thickness equal to half of the diameter: a disc", "props": { "size": "sm", "thickness": 24 }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 48, "thickness": 24, "boxInline": 48, "boxBlock": 48 } },
    { "name": "thickness over half of the diameter is clamped to the half", "props": { "size": "sm", "thickness": 40 }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 48, "thickness": 24, "boxInline": 48, "boxBlock": 48 } },
    { "name": "zero thickness: nothing is drawn, the box stays", "props": { "size": "md", "thickness": "none" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 0, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "a big ring with a thick arc", "props": { "size": "md", "thickness": 16 }, "style": { "width": 240, "height": 240 }, "expect": { "diameter": 240, "thickness": 16, "boxInline": 240, "boxBlock": 240 } },
    { "name": "348: a label in the middle does not enlarge the box: size md with a percent label is 72 × 72, not 72 × 77", "props": { "size": "md", "labelFormat": "percent" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 72, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 72, "boxBlock": 72 } },
    { "name": "348: the same with the label «value of max»", "props": { "size": "sm", "labelFormat": "valueOfMax" }, "style": {}, "expect": { "diameter": 48, "thickness": 8, "boxInline": 48, "boxBlock": 48 } }
  ],
  "arcCases": [
    { "name": "a quarter, LTR: from the top to three o'clock", "ratio": 0.25, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "startDeg": 0, "sweepDeg": 90 } },
    { "name": "a quarter, RTL: the SAME arc, the ring is not mirrored", "ratio": 0.25, "direction": "rtl", "expect": { "startDeg": 0, "sweepDeg": 90 } },
    { "name": "three quarters: to nine o'clock", "ratio": 0.75, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "startDeg": 0, "sweepDeg": 270 } },
    { "name": "nothing", "ratio": 0, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "startDeg": 0, "sweepDeg": 0 } },
    { "name": "the whole circle", "ratio": 1, "direction": "rtl", "expect": { "startDeg": 0, "sweepDeg": 360 } }
  ],
  "barCases": [
    { "name": "no thickness field: the token sm", "props": {}, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 8, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 4, "fillRadius": 4, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "thickness by a token", "props": { "thickness": "lg" }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 16, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 8, "fillRadius": 8, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "thickness by a number", "props": { "thickness": 20 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 20, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 10, "fillRadius": 10, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "RTL: the fill grows from the right", "props": { "thickness": 20 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "rtl", "expect": { "trackBlock": 20, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 10, "fillRadius": 10, "fillFrom": "right" } },
    { "name": "a fill narrower than the thickness: a narrow oval, the radius is half of its WIDTH", "props": { "thickness": 20 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.02, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 20, "fillInline": 6, "trackRadius": 10, "fillRadius": 3, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "empty scale: no fill", "props": { "thickness": 20 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 20, "fillInline": 0, "trackRadius": 10, "fillRadius": 0, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "full scale: the fill is the track", "props": { "thickness": 20 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 1, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 20, "fillInline": 300, "trackRadius": 10, "fillRadius": 10, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "the thickest bar: the radius is half of the thickness while it is under the pill token", "props": { "thickness": 128 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 128, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 64, "fillRadius": 64, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "a short thick track: the radius is half of the shorter side", "props": { "thickness": 128 }, "trackInline": 100, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 128, "fillInline": 50, "trackRadius": 50, "fillRadius": 25, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "zero thickness: no track and no fill", "props": { "thickness": "none" }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "trackBlock": 0, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 0, "fillRadius": 0, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "a token the theme does not declare: the default thickness", "props": { "thickness": "huge" }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "trackBlock": 8, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 4, "fillRadius": 4, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "a thickness of a wrong form (a fraction): the default thickness", "props": { "thickness": 12.5 }, "trackInline": 300, "ratio": 0.5, "direction": "ltr", "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "trackBlock": 8, "fillInline": 150, "trackRadius": 4, "fillRadius": 4, "fillFrom": "left" } }
  ],
  "paintCases": [
    { "name": "no new fields: the scale as before 9.7.0", "props": { "color": "primary" }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "track color by a token", "props": { "color": "primary", "trackColor": "surface" }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#ffffff", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "the white ring on a gradient: a 30% white track under a white fill", "props": { "color": "surface", "trackColor": { "token": "surface", "opacity": 0.3 } }, "ratio": 0.75, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#ffffff", "opacity": 0.3 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#ffffff", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "track color by an own value", "props": { "color": "primary", "trackColor": { "value": "#102030" } }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#102030", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "track color by an own value with opacity", "props": { "color": "primary", "trackColor": { "value": "#102030", "opacity": 0.2 } }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#102030", "opacity": 0.2 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "a track token the theme does not declare: the default track", "props": { "color": "primary", "trackColor": "ghost" }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "a track color of a wrong form: the default track", "props": { "color": "primary", "trackColor": "#FFF" }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "a translucent fill: the track stays under it, the fill is painted over", "props": { "color": { "token": "primary", "opacity": 0.5 } }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 0.5 } } },
    { "name": "a fill token the theme does not declare: the default of the field", "props": { "color": "ghost" }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "gradient token, full scale: the stops span the whole scale", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": "brand" }, "ratio": 1, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#0369a1", "opacity": 1, "at": 1 }] } } },
    { "name": "gradient token, half of the scale: the WHOLE gradient lies on the filled half", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": "brand" }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#0369a1", "opacity": 1, "at": 0.5 }] } } },
    { "name": "the gradient is stronger than a named color", "props": { "color": "success", "gradient": "brand" }, "ratio": 1, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#0369a1", "opacity": 1, "at": 1 }] } } },
    { "name": "three stops at 40%: the middle stop is at 20% of the scale; the angle of the token is not read", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": "tricolor" }, "ratio": 0.4, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#ff0000", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#00ff00", "opacity": 1, "at": 0.2 }, { "hex": "#0000ff", "opacity": 1, "at": 0.4 }] } } },
    { "name": "stops that do not start at 0 and do not end at 1: the first color runs from the start of the scale, the last one to the end of the fill", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": "inset" }, "ratio": 0.8, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1, "at": 0.2 }, { "hex": "#15803d", "opacity": 1, "at": 0.6 }] } } },
    { "name": "empty scale with a gradient: every stop is at the start, nothing is drawn", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": "brand" }, "ratio": 0, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#0369a1", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }] } } },
    { "name": "own gradient of color references: tokens and a tint", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": { "angle": 180, "stops": [{ "color": "primary", "position": 0 }, { "color": { "token": "accent", "opacity": 0.5 }, "position": 1 }] } }, "ratio": 1, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#4f46e5", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#0369a1", "opacity": 0.5, "at": 1 }] } } },
    { "name": "own gradient of own colors", "props": { "color": "primary", "gradient": { "angle": 90, "stops": [{ "color": { "value": "#ffffff" }, "position": 0 }, { "color": { "value": "#ffffff", "opacity": 0.4 }, "position": 1 }] } }, "ratio": 0.5, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "gradient", "stops": [{ "hex": "#ffffff", "opacity": 1, "at": 0 }, { "hex": "#ffffff", "opacity": 0.4, "at": 0.5 }] } } },
    { "name": "a gradient token the theme does not declare: the solid color", "props": { "color": "success", "gradient": "sunset" }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#15803d", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "own gradient with unordered stops is not drawn: the solid color", "props": { "color": "success", "gradient": { "angle": 90, "stops": [{ "color": "primary", "position": 0.8 }, { "color": "accent", "position": 0.2 }] } }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#15803d", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "own gradient with a stop on an unknown color: the solid color, not the gradient without the stop", "props": { "color": "success", "gradient": { "angle": 90, "stops": [{ "color": "primary", "position": 0 }, { "color": "ghost", "position": 1 }] } }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#15803d", "opacity": 1 } } },
    { "name": "a gradient of a wrong form (one stop): the solid color", "props": { "color": "success", "gradient": { "angle": 90, "stops": [{ "color": "primary", "position": 0 }] } }, "ratio": 0.5, "readerOnly": true, "expect": { "track": { "hex": "#eef0f6", "opacity": 1 }, "fill": { "kind": "color", "hex": "#15803d", "opacity": 1 } } }
  ],
  "segmentsNote": "Schema 9.11.0 — «ProgressBar.segments»: the same scale cut into equal steps. Rules: x-style.layout.progressSegments; policy rows unreadableSegments, segmentsSemantics. The gap between steps is the token xs (4). «states» — one letter per step from the logical start: f — filled, c — current (the first unfilled one), u — unfilled. Widths and starts are not rounded. «expect: null» — the steps are not drawn, the bar is continuous with the same ratio. In a right-to-left language the same numbers are measured from the right edge. «segmentPlaceCases»: the kind of the bar — steps or continuous — is decided by the width the PLACE gives it (`placeInline`), never by its own measure; the own minimum width is the same in both kinds — (segments − 1) × gap — so a bar in a place «by content» does not flip between the kinds on every frame.",
  "segmentCases": [
    { "name": "six steps on a track of 320, half of the scale", "props": { "segments": 6 }, "trackInline": 320, "value": 3, "max": 6, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "inline": 50, "starts": [0, 54, 108, 162, 216, 270], "filled": 3, "current": 3, "states": "fffcuu", "radius": 4, "filledInline": 158, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "the same in a right-to-left language: the first step is on the right", "props": { "segments": 6 }, "trackInline": 320, "value": 3, "max": 6, "direction": "rtl", "expect": { "inline": 50, "starts": [0, 54, 108, 162, 216, 270], "filled": 3, "current": 3, "states": "fffcuu", "radius": 4, "filledInline": 158, "fillFrom": "right" } },
    { "name": "a track of 329: half pixels, nothing is rounded", "props": { "segments": 6 }, "trackInline": 329, "value": 0, "max": 6, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "inline": 51.5, "starts": [0, 55.5, 111, 166.5, 222, 277.5], "filled": 0, "current": 0, "states": "cuuuuu", "radius": 4, "filledInline": 0, "fillFrom": "left" } },
    { "name": "every step filled: there is no current step", "props": { "segments": 6 }, "trackInline": 320, "value": 6, "max": 6, "direction": "ltr", "expect": { "inline": 50, "starts": [0, 54, 108, 162, 216, 270], "filled": 6, "current": null, "states": "ffffff", "radius": 4, "filledInline": 320, "fillFrom": "left" } },
